"entity": {
"name": "STEF",
"description": "STEF engages in the provision of temperature-controlled road transport and logistics, as well as maritime transport. It operates through the STEF France and STEF International segments. The STEF France segment provides transport, logistics, and packaging services in France. The STEF International segment focuses on international activities in Italy, Spain, Portugal, Belgium, the Netherlands, Switzerland, and the United Kingdom. The Others segment includes sales of goods for out-of-home food service. The company was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Paris, France.",
